    {
      "id": "DIMrvSmksKEUvhegjeqUx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3265,
      "y": 785,
      "width": 384.97564697265625,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "frameId": "U4yopliWhSk57_ID2Fcxo",
      "index": "auzzzd",
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Outcomes\n1. While the first complete build didn't \"fail\", it\ntook some human in the loop iterations (3 total),\nand took 6 hours\n2. Final run with the same requirements was able\nto complete all requirements in code quality and\npattern in 1/4 of the time/token. No human\nintervention was needed. $$$ saving",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "TMvUdO7qgsBWrN-tod2z2",
      "originalText": "Outcomes\n1. While the first complete build didn't \"fail\", it took some human in the loop iterations (3 total), and took 6 hours\n2. Final run with the same requirements was able to complete all requirements in code quality and pattern in 1/4 of the time/token. No human intervention was needed. $$$ saving",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
